Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:52:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Reduce command tree node lookups

Insert a new command node with one hash table probe and enqueue its
children and redirect only if insertion changed the map size. Retain the
original breadth-first numbering and default return value.

Ported from Lophine (GPLv3 for its changes; see licenses/GPL.md):
